      "kind": "summary",
      "headline": "[SAMPLE] Fed holds its benchmark rate steady, signals patience on further cuts",
      "body": "The Federal Reserve kept its policy rate unchanged after its two-day meeting. Officials said inflation has eased but remains above their 2% goal, and that future moves will depend on incoming data on jobs and prices.",
