      "importance": 10.0,
      "detail": {
        "paragraphs": [
          "The Federal Reserve kept its main interest rate the same after a two-day meeting.",
          "The Fed is the U.S. central bank. It raises or lowers this rate to slow down or speed up the economy.",
          "Officials said prices are rising more slowly than before, but still faster than their 2% goal. They said their next steps depend on new numbers about jobs and prices."
        ],
